Package: TxParq.Hs.gencode.v49
Title: Parquet-based representation of GENCODE gene models v49 for Homo sapiens
Version: 0.99.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Vince",
           family = "Carey",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "stvjc@channing.harvard.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4046-0063"))
Description: This is a parquet-based representation of GENCODE gene models v49 for Homo sapiens.
    Parquet is chosen to reduce footprint, to support tidyverse-oriented operations
    natively, and to provide opportunities for cloud-backed annotation services.
    Community contributions to functionality and architecture are welcome.
Depends: R (>= 4.6.0), utils
Suggests: knitr, BiocStyle, testthat, rmarkdown
Imports: dplyr, arrow, GenomicRanges, GenomeInfoDb, stats,
	GenomicFeatures, IRanges, methods, S4Vectors
